  "notes": "The knowledge base's discipline (Smite) priest: Enlighten and Inner Focus upkeep, Holy Fire to keep the Purifying Flames debuff up (four Smites fit one cycle), Smite as the filler, Shadow Word: Pain while moving, Pain Spike on a dying mob, rank-1 Holy Fire when mana is low, Holy Nova at four or more targets. Chastise and the tier-set cycles need a friendly target or a gear check the conditions lack and are listed in kb.unexpressed.",
